# SystemVerilog source list (Verilator command-file syntax). Consumed by the
# Makefile and flow/runner.py. Each non-comment, non-blank line is one of:
#   <path>           a compilation source (Verilator/slang/cocotb and Verible)
#   +incdir+<dir>    a preprocessor include search directory
#   +define+<NAME[=VALUE]>  a preprocessor macro (bare flag, or NAME=VALUE)
# Every referenced path is validated to exist when this file is parsed.
# Verible-only files (`include`d, not compiled) go in rtl/verible.vf instead.
+incdir+rtl
rtl/top.sv
